[45.313603, "o", "\u001b[1G\u001b[0K\u001b[1mnpm\u001b[22m \u001b[33mwarn\u001b[39m \u001b[94mdeprecated\u001b[39m core-js@2.6.12: core-js@<3.23.3 is no longer maintained and not recommended for usage due to the number of issues. Because of the V8 engine whims, feature detection in old core-js versions could cause a slowdown up to 100x even if nothing is polyfilled. Some versions have web compatibility issues. Please, upgrade your dependencies to the actual version of core-js.\r\n⠋"]
